  "scope": "Only comparison predicates and their conjunctions silently widen, as design/refinement-types.md requires. Structural NonZero and mixed structural predicates retain their carrier at open generic arguments and need explicit unrefine for projection. All11 self-contained controls pass both current Native8ba8 and the actual previously compiled exact a029 Cinch checker, including range widening and refusal controls. This is a direct checker replay, not a completed whole-group or full compiler/Stage3 gate. Every original NamedRefinements case/assertion and fresh-build path remains; eight whole original groups and exact-source gates are running. The earlier broad db9a hypothesis violated the intentional range rule and is superseded. Two subsequent setup errors (unavailable standard list constructors and an intentionally guarded different cached checker entry) are preserved. No cache guard or selected-frontend rule has been weakened. Full original mconcat runtime, API/diagnostic, matching bootstrap and complete suites remain required.",
